<title>USA: IndeNet, Sutro settle legal actions.</title>
<headline>IndeNet, Sutro settle legal actions.</headline>
<dateline>ENCINO, Calif. 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>IndeNet Inc on Friday said it has settled all prior legal actions with Sutro &amp; Co Inc, a California-based investment bank for an undisclosed sum of money.</p>
<p>In a statement, IndeNet said the settlement sum will not materially affect either company.</p>
<p>Both companies have formally ceased all legal proceedings against each other.</p>
</text>
